WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.767
Visits and phone calls on the phone.

00:00:03.433 --> 00:00:09.300
My appointments. Visits, call-backs and tasks the office booked for you, today first.

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:14.467
A visit. The customer, what it's for and when, with Directions and Call.

00:00:14.967 --> 00:00:19.900
Notes from the visit. What the customer wants, access, the gate code.

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.533
Measurements. Write them as you take them.

00:00:24.033 --> 00:00:29.100
Photos. The yard and the area to quote. They show in the office straight away.

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:35.700
Save. Everything you saved is on the appointment in the office, for whoever writes the estimate.

00:00:36.200 --> 00:00:42.367
Visit done, estimate pending. The office sees the visit is done and the quote is waiting.

00:00:42.867 --> 00:00:49.233
A phone call. A call shows one big button with the number. Write what was said, then mark it done.

00:00:49.733 --> 00:00:54.700
That's it. The crew app speaks Spanish too, when the phone app is set to Spanish.
